msgctxt "64"
msgid "(What's up with this crowd?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Did you get hoodwinked by Sawada, too? He talked big about\r\n"
"that tuna farm of his, but it turned out to be one big\r\n"
"pack of lies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I bought a thousand shares! What's this photo supposed to\r\n"
"be, anyway? I hope that swindler gets what's coming to him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"What little pension I had went to his scam... If I don't\r\n"
"get that money back, I won't be able to afford to live\r\n"
"in public housing anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Sawada, that bastard... Looks like he already skipped town.\r\n"
"This office is just an empty shell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"We've got to call the police and file a report so they can\r\n"
"track him down before he gets away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"(Something's fishy. This place is too neat for him to\r\n"
"have run away in the night.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Eep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Sawada! I figured you'd be hiding here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Damn it! I thought everyone was gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Hey, guys! Get in here! Give this guy a beatdown so we\r\n"
"can run off to Hokkaido already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"C'mon, get him! Whoever takes him out gets a nice, fat\r\n"
"bonus!"
msgstr ""

